{"id":3,"date":"2026-02-17T21:05:42","date_gmt":"2026-02-17T21:05:42","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/localhost:8080\/?page_id=3"},"modified":"2026-04-01T01:16:10","modified_gmt":"2026-04-01T01:16:10","slug":"privacy-policy","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/localhost:8080\/privacy-policy\/","title":{"rendered":"Privacy Policy"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"3\" class=\"elementor elementor-3\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eca1fd0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"eca1fd0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dcaa421 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"dcaa421\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Privacy Policy<span style=\"font-size: 3rem;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit\"><\/span><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5cf624a8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5cf624a8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Your privacy is extremely important to us. We are committed to respecting your privacy and protecting any personal information you may provide through our site, SaaS, located at https:\/\/saas.mateuspitura.com.<\/p>\n<h3>Information Collection<\/h3>\n<p>We request your personal information only when it is strictly necessary to provide our services to you. We collect this information in a fair and lawful manner, with your knowledge and explicit consent. We also inform you of the reasons for collecting it and how it will be used.<\/p>\n<h3>Use and Storage of Information<\/h3>\n<p>We retain the information collected only for as long as necessary to provide the requested service. We store data protected by technically appropriate security measures to prevent loss, theft, unauthorized access, disclosure, copying, use, or alteration.<\/p>\n<h3>Information Sharing<\/h3>\n<p>We do not share your personal information publicly or with third parties except when required by law.<\/p>\n<h3>External Sites<\/h3>\n<p>Our site may contain links to external sites that are not operated by us. Please be aware that we do not control these sites and cannot assume responsibility for their privacy policies.<\/p>\n<h3>Refusal of Information<\/h3>\n<p>You may choose not to provide your personal information, with the understanding that this may prevent us from providing certain services to you.<\/p>\n<h3>Acceptance of This Policy<\/h3>\n<p>Your continued use of our site indicates acceptance of our privacy policy. If you have any questions about how we manage user data and personal information, please do not hesitate to contact us.<\/p>\n<h3>User Commitment<\/h3>\n<p>By using this site, you agree to:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Not engage in illegal activities or activities contrary to ethics and public order;<\/li>\n<li>Not disseminate discriminatory, illegal content or content that promotes harmful activities against human rights;<\/li>\n<li>Not cause damage to the physical and logical systems of this site, its suppliers, or third parties.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>More Information<\/h3>\n<p>We hope you are clear about cookies. If you are unsure about something, we recommend keeping cookies enabled to ensure our site&#8217;s functionalities work as expected.<\/p>\n<p>This policy is effective from February 20, 2026.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Privacy Policy Your privacy is extremely important to us. We are commit